{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_ceylon_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ceylon_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "留下的人",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ceylon_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7df8fbf786e2246ec6e6b3bde4f29183055285f37f583a59ebb71e862b8d0f92",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "真的不能通融一下吗，主任？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "沙漏，你应该比我更清楚，感染者的遗体是不可能被带出去举行葬礼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "那骨灰呢，骨灰应该可以吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......即使是骨灰，也需要经过特殊处理，确认无风险之后才能被取出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "办事处刚建立没多久，这方面的设施功能还很不完善。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "要多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "就算我现在立刻提出申请，从本舰审批到器材运到，至少也需要半年时间吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......你知道这有多残忍吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我身为她的主治医师和唯一的亲友，却没能在最后一刻守在她身边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "在那之后，她的遗体就被隔离了起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "而现在，我想要拿到她的骨灰，竟然需要申请。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "这份申请还没有办法立刻通过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "拜托你，别让我为难，沙漏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "这些规定每一条你都知道来由，甚至其中有一些是我们一起制定的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "主任，我为罗德岛工作了一年，这是我唯一的请求......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我没法在她活着的时候陪她去旅行，至少在她死后......我想带着她的骨灰出去走一走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "这是她最后的愿望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我们是医生，我们必须对其他人负责，沙漏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "医生就必须扼杀自己的私情吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "别逼我和你吵架，沙漏......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我知道你很难过，我也——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "如果未来，黑小姐也迎来了这一天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "你也能像现在这样用规定来说服自己吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯终端提示声",
      "text": "遗体处理即将开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通讯终端提示声",
      "text": "请负责人认证识别码后进入焚化室开始处理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "所有的遗体处理都要由办事处的主任，也就是我经手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果你愿意的话，这次我可以破例交给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我能做的......只有这样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我没有在她生命的最后一刻见到她，也没法实现她的愿望，我没有脸去见她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "换上了全套防护装备的锡兰，熟练地拉过躺着迪丽雅遗体的推车，向着焚化设备推去。\n时至今日，她已经习惯了见到和处理感染者的尸体。\n虽然每一次都会让她心中绞痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙漏的语气中带着明显的怨怼，但锡兰并没有因此感到不忿。\n她的立场让她必须承受这些怨气，在她决定帮助罗德岛建立这个办事处时，她就已经做好了心理准备。\n至于这个问题——\n“我和黑会怎么样，不用你来担心！”\n她差点下意识这样反驳，但她当然不能。\n就像她也绝不会轻易地对沙漏说：“我理解你的痛苦。”\n然而，无论沙漏是以什么样的心情问出那句话的，至少在过去的无数个夜晚，锡兰已经为那种可能哭了太多次。\n但每一次，她都会擦干眼泪，然后继续看文献写报告。\n眼泪没有研究成果和特效药有用，她是这么相信的。\n假设有一天，躺在眼前这辆推车上的是黑，而推着车的是其他人，那只有可能是她在寻找救治黑的方法的路上被困住了。\n而如果真的发生了那样的事，她想她会接受的。\n我已经为此拼尽全力了。她想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "对不起，迪丽雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我们总是无法两全其美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她将推车上的遗体推入焚化设备中。\n沉默片刻，她按下了按钮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......晚安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......你在看什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "海。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "她其实不喜欢海，她说，从小看到大，早就看腻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "她一直想去旅行，总说等到存够了钱就去，但最后也没去成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我已经冷静下来了，刚才很抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "没事的，你能理解就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "过几天，我会为迪丽雅举办一场葬礼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你已经安排好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "是啊，她的后事我早就安排好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "即使没有她的骨灰，葬礼也会照常举行，我今天只是想最后争取一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "你没有任何需要说抱歉的地方，我知道你也很难过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "只是......人在这种时候，总是会没那么理智。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "你会来参加葬礼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "从风情街到沙滩的道路是用花朵铺成的，道路的两边摆着巨大的花篮。\n在道路的尽头，有一个临时搭建的小型宴会场地，那里布置了一个舞台，台下整齐地摆放着十几张椅子。\n舞台的墙上，高高挂着一张迪丽雅的照片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬礼司仪",
      "text": "迪丽雅女士的父母早亡，而她在感染矿石病后也孑然一身，身边称得上挚友的只有一人，那就是蕾娜塔女士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬礼司仪",
      "text": "接下来，我们有请蕾娜塔女士发表悼词。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬礼司仪",
      "text": "咳咳，出于一些特殊原因，蕾娜塔女士不方便露面，我们将通过广播的形式播放她的悼词。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "在我痛恨着周遭的一切，想要让大海带走自己时，我在海边遇到了正在跳舞卖艺的迪丽雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "迪丽雅似乎看出了我的心事，在我的面前跳了一支舞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "我永远记得那支舞，迪丽雅在沙滩上不停地旋转、跳跃，带起的裙摆在阳光下熠熠生辉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "而这些天，我的脑海中，全都是那支舞，我怎么样也忘不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "我将与她有关的回忆整理成相册，我以为我已经做得足够多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "我以为我已经为她的离开做好了充足的心理准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "但是，在我不知道第几次从梦中惊醒却意识到她已不在时，我发现，我做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏的声音",
      "text": "我是那么地想要再次见到她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "锡兰感到格外地伤感，她无法想象如果有一天，轮到自己经历这一切，自己能否承受得住。\n黑还有时间，她知道自己并不能真正与沙漏感同身受。\n然而，光是在无数个夜晚中那些不可遏制的幻想所带来的惶恐，足以在此时与沙漏所描绘的痛苦重合，撬开她本就脆弱的心防。\n她想见到沙漏，她想和沙漏聊一聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "司仪先生，请问，沙漏......蕾娜塔女士她现在在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬礼司仪",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我是她的上司，您可以信任我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葬礼司仪",
      "text": "......好吧。她刚才将录音交给我之后就不知道去哪儿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......我来了，迪丽雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "结果，我还是骗了主任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "这点小伎俩肯定很快就会被识破吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "但是，只要一会儿就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "只要一会儿，足够我带走你，足够我们离开这里，足够我们远走高飞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我会带你去我们曾经一起去过的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我也会带你一起去你曾经想去，但最终没有去成的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "然后，我们找个能够欣赏日落的地方安静地生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙漏一边自言自语，一边在存放骨灰的柜子上寻找着迪丽雅的名字。\n她在这里当了一年的医生，也治疗过不少病人，看着一个个熟悉的名字从眼前划过，她感到自己的手在微微颤抖。\n最终，她找到了迪丽雅的名字。\n柜子的位置有点高，她只能从旁边拉一张椅子过来，椅子和地板摩擦发出的吱呀声在房间中回荡，让她的心跳漏了几拍。\n她踩上椅子，颤抖着将钥匙插向写着迪丽雅名字的柜子的钥匙孔。\n但或许是泪水模糊了视线，又或者是她的手抖得太厉害了，她怎么也插不进那个钥匙孔。\n她就这样试了一次，两次，许多次。\n直到泪流满面。\n直到钥匙从手中滑落。\n直到她因为想去接钥匙而从椅子上摔下。\n直到她瘫坐在地上怔怔出神。\n直到她嚎啕大哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "对不起，迪丽雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "对不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "是我，你们有见到沙漏吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "咦，主任，你不是刚刚才让沙漏过来取走迪丽雅女士的骨灰吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "她现在人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "刚才她一边哭一边离开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "现在立刻——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "咦，怪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "是这样的，主任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "因为我看她样子很奇怪，所以她走后我也想过来看看到底什么情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "沙漏没带走迪丽雅女士的骨灰啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "办事处干员",
      "text": "是的，看起来她甚至没有打开过柜子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......我马上回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "是怎么跳的来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我记得她教过我的。应该是这样，先转一个圈，然后再转一个——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "唉，我还是这么笨手笨脚的，永远不能像你那样跳出热烈的舞蹈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "沙漏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "你是怎么找到这里的，主任？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你的录音里提到了你们第一次相遇的海滩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我以前也常来这里玩，一下子就听出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......对不起，主任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我在你参加葬礼的时候，偷偷用了你的许可证。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "这种小事......好吧，这确实不算小事。但是，为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "主任，你觉得，怎样才算是为挚爱之人的离世做好了准备？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "你说，你会为了不让她离开而拼尽全力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "而我，我记录下了有关她的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "但是，结果呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "结果她离开后，我没有一夜能够安稳入睡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "最后，甚至铤而走险，打算偷走她的骨灰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但你为什么又放弃了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "在我看到存放她骨灰的柜子时，我就已经知道，我在做的事情是那么没有意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我想带走的又怎么会是她的骨灰呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "她已经死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我只是无论如何都想要再见她一面，而这种无论如何，在最后化作了那样愚蠢的行为。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我在那一刻醒悟的只有一件事，那就是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "她永远都不会回来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我没能做好任何准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我又怎么可能做好准备呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "锡兰缓缓走到沙漏身边坐下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "在我很小的时候，父亲工作总是很忙，于是黑自然而然成了我的保镖兼玩伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "那时候，我最喜欢做的事情，就是从家里溜出去，向着火山的方向走去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我从来没有成功过，因为每次我都会在半路被黑拦下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "不过，黑每次拦住我的地方，周围都会有一些好玩或者有趣的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "于是，我就会顺势在那里玩个痛快，然后跟着黑回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "那时候，我以为，这样的时光可以永远持续下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "直到我知道了矿石病是一种什么样的病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "于是我立下志向，未来，我一定要治好黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果真要比较的话，我其实比你还要自私。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "只是，对我来说，如果有一个机会能够治好她，我一定会去抓住它，哪怕这样会牺牲我和她相处的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我想，这样的话，至少在最后的时刻，我可以宽慰自己——我为她付出了我所有的时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但是，就像你说的，你错了，我也错了。面对至亲之人的离世，我们做的任何准备都没有意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我刚才在葬礼上，光是听你说的那些就已经受不了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果黑离开我的那一天真的到来......我大概只会比你更疯狂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "曾经的我又何尝不是呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "在真正面对死亡带来的离别之前，我们每个人都是一样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "自大，盲目，以为自己能够撑下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "死亡并不只是带走了一个人的生命，它也会带走和这个人最亲密的人的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我们将永远残缺地活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果，我是说如果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果你真的带走了她的骨灰，你打算去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我......会和她的骨灰一起去旅行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我想和她一起走一遍我们曾经走过的土地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我想带着她的骨灰前往我们还没来得及一起去的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "但是......这也只是我的一厢情愿而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我说，去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我没有告诉其他人是你盗用了我的许可证，名义上，你现在依然拥有带走迪丽雅骨灰的许可。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我会回一趟本舰，正式提出申请，为你获得旅行的机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "当然，作为惩罚，我会扣掉你半年的工资。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "以及，新汐斯塔还没有合适的保存容器，我也会请工程部想想办法，准备好合适的容器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "这至少比等机器运过来花的时间要少一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "只是，你去每一个地方都要和附近的罗德岛办事处打个招呼，我也会让他们检查你的容器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "一旦发生危险情况，或者发现你将她的骨灰撒在了什么地方——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你就完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但是，除此之外，我也会让他们配合你，你想去什么地方祭奠迪丽雅都是你的自由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......已经没有意义了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我们错了，但是——我们真的错了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "面对死亡，我们做了一切我们能做的挣扎，如果离别不可避免，如果残缺终将发生——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "那么，那个人留下的痕迹，我想，是唯一能够让我们稍微填补残缺的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "......抱歉，看起来好像理解你一样地说了这样一些话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我们的立场不同，状况也不同，我没有资格命令你做任何事。我只是在想，未来，如果属于我的那一天也终于到来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我一定也会和你一样，去重走每一个我们曾经共同留下痕迹的地方，在那些地方大哭一场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "等我哭完了，嗓子哑了，泪流干了，我再去想别的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "如果连这样都没有办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "到时候，我们再来聊一聊吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "谢谢你，主任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "我不保证我能像你说的那样坚强......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙漏",
      "text": "但是，我可以试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "Medic，我的情况怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "和去年相比，有些发展的倾向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "不太妙，你这两年作为教官和干员活动得有些太频繁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "我会和上面申请，减轻你的工作负担。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "那我的调任申请——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "你回到新汐斯塔后，肯定会继续勉强自己吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我会好好休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "骗人，你都已经来罗德岛两年了，大家都了解你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "你呀，还是太不会照顾自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "虽然让锡兰照顾你是最合适的，但新汐斯塔办事处现在才刚起步，至少也要等一年再让你回去我们才放心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "那就让我来本舰照顾黑好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "小姐？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "哎呀，锡兰，你这就回来啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "我还想说给黑一个惊喜呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "哎，那我不是打断你了？不好意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "门外的锡兰",
      "text": "再来一次！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "咳咳。不过，黑，你也不用太担心，针对你的情况，我们有一个更好的解决方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "那就是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "锵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "没错，在你回来后没多久，锡兰主动申请返回本舰待一段时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "好啦，问题解决。你们聊吧，我就不打扰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "呃，小姐......你不是要在新汐斯塔大展拳脚吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我和父亲聊了聊，他同意在一些事情上给罗德岛开绿灯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "那边我暂时不在也没关系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我这边也不用你担心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "你刚才绝对在想怎么对我隐瞒病情吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "那倒是......没有。反正你总会知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "哼，这还差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "Medic说得对，你确实需要一些休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "所以，我们去旅行吧，黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "去哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我忽然想起来，你以前和我说过你出生的城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但我还从来没有去过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "那里......没留下什么东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "但我们可以在那里留下些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "而且，虽然我知道你当佣兵时的经历，但你还没说过你的童年呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......怎么了，小姐，这么突然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我只是忽然觉得，你看着我长大，对我的一切都了如指掌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我却还没有完全了解你的过去，这可不公平。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "我可是个很贪心的人，黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "text": "知道就好。现在，让我看看你的体检报告。然后，我们再来制定一下旅行计划。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
